			"arabicnumber": 3451,
			"text": "It was narrated that Jabir bin ‘Abdullah said:“Some honey was given as a gift to the Prophet (ﷺ), and he shared among us spoonful by spoonful. I took my spoonful then I said: ‘O Messenger of Allah, can I have another?’ He said: ‘Yes.’”",
